Z||000000||Neverfinished||03-27-2001||10:29 PM||||I heard on the grape vine of a fiero at the local wreckers. I step into the tear down building and I see a 1987 GT maroon. A tear runs from my eye. This guy drove his fiero off a cliff. like 15 down. on all four wheels. The thing that hurts the most is that the interior is MINT .Its grey and even the dash is pewrfect in every way. The passenger side seat looks like it never was sat in. Oh well, at least I have a new GT steering wheel, door handles,cruise control,and possibly the body.<P>everyone have a moment for this once beautiful creature. At least its memory will live on in many other fieros. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||9
